PG  - 175-7
AB  - A 33-year-old male presented with repeated episodes of blood-streaked sputum for 
      last one-and half-year. Chest radiograph showed consolidation in the right lower 
      zone. Fibreoptic bronchoscopy revealed an endoluminal growth in the right lower 
      lobe bronchus. Histopathological examination of bronchoscopic biopsy specimen 
      confirmed adenoid cystic carcinoma.
