TI  - Mucosa-associated lymphoid tissue lymphoma of the trachea.
PG  - 44-6
LID - 10.1097/LBR.0b013e31823fadc2 [doi]
AB  - Primary malignant lymphoma of the trachea is rare. We report a case of a 
      60-year-old woman with a mucosa-associated lymphoid tissue lymphoma of the 
      trachea and review the existing literature. This case highlights the importance 
      of including intraluminal lesions in the differential diagnosis when a variable 
      degree of obstruction is seen on pulmonary function testing.
