AB  - Treatment of tracheal cicatricial stenosis is one of the most difficult problems 
      of modem medicine. There are two main therapeutic approaches--endoscopic 
      (bronchoscopic) and surgical (open). The paper describes the methods of 
      endoscopic treatment of stenoses allowing achieving complete recovery of tracheal 
      lumen in some cases. The scheme of treatment for tracheal cicatricial stenosis is 
      also described.
