TI  - [Pulmonary aspergillosis in an immunocompetent and previously healthy patient].
PG  - 124-6
LID - S0037-86822011000100030 [pii]
AB  - Pulmonary aspergillosis includes one of the forms of fungal infection due to the 
      genus Aspergillus, and has several modes of clinical presentation that depend on 
      the immunity and comorbidities. The aim of this study was to report on the case 
      of an immunocompetent and previously healthy patient who developed a form of 
      chronic pulmonary aspergillosis, and to make a brief review on the subject.
