AB  - In the last decade, major advances have been made in interventional bronchoscopy. 
      Notable techniques are tracheobronchial laser, endoprosthesis placement and 
      endobronchial ultrasound bronchoscopy. The indications and applications for these 
      three bronchoscopic techniques are reviewed. I.
