AB  - Croup is common in children but recurrent croup is unusual. A 4-year-11-month-old 
      boy presented with recurrent croup. Physical examination revealed decreased 
      breath sounds over left lower chest. Chest x-ray disclosed segmental atelectasis 
      over left lower chest and a mass shadow over mediastinum.
