TI  - Primary non-small cell lung cancer response upon treatment with denosumab.
PG  - 506-8
LID - S0169-5002(13)00395-4 [pii]
LID - 10.1016/j.lungcan.2013.08.030 [doi]
AB  - Here we report the case of a patient with metastatic adenocarcinoma of the lung 
      harboring an ALK gene translocation. In this patient a response of the primary 
      tumor and metastases has been detected upon treatment with denosumab. A possible 
      link between ALK and RANK is postulated.
