TI  - EBUS-TBNA in a case of mediastinal lymphangioma.
PG  - 153-5
LID - 10.1097/LBR.0b013e31824d8d66 [doi]
AB  - Mediastinal lymphangioma is a rare benign tumor that can be a cause of dyspnea. 
      In our case, endobronchial ultrasound-transbronchial needle aspiration in 
      addition to computed tomography imaging was a useful diagnostic tool in narrowing 
      down the differential diagnosis of this mediastinal mass and to find a suitable 
      therapeutic intervention.
