TI  - Barotrauma as aetiological cascade of fatal intrapulmonary plastic bronchitis in 
      a post-Fontan child.
PG  - 805-7
AB  - The role of barotrauma in the exaggeration of plastic bronchitis after Fontan 
      circulation has yet to be examined. We aim to describe a case of a 4-year old 
      post-Fontan circulation girl where barotrauma suffered during commercial air 
      travel played a role in the aetiological cascade of plastic bronchitis.
