TI  - Severe airway obstruction from a bronchial cast after cardiac transplantation.
PG  - 739-40
LID - 10.1017/S1047951113001066 [doi]
AB  - Plastic bronchitis is a rare and difficult to treat disease process in patients 
      with congenital heart disease. Cardiac transplantation has been used increasingly 
      to reverse this process, especially in single ventricle physiology. This case 
      report demonstrates a foreseeable complication after cardiac transplantation in 
      such a patient.
