AB  - Endobronchial lipoma is a rare benign neoplasm of the tracheobronchial tree. 
      Despite its benign nature, associated endoluminal polypoid growth can cause 
      bronchial occlusion. In this paper, we present the consequences of a late 
      diagnosis of this condition.
