TI  - [Chronic pneumonia?].
PG  - 673-7
LID - 10.1024/0040-5930/a000347 [doi]
AB  - The differential diagnosis of persistent radiologic pulmonary shadow is broad and 
      is illustrated and discussed with the help of four patients histories. The term 
      chronic pneumonia is a misnomer. Particularly, slowly growing types of lung 
      cancer should be considered as a potential etiology. They are potentially curable 
      by surgical resection. Other diseases can be treated as soon as they are 
      specified with appropriate diagnostic methods.
