AB  - Flexible bronchoscopy is an essential, established and expanding tool in 
      respiratory medicine. Its practice, however, needs to be safe, effective and for 
      the right indications to maximise clinical utility. This guideline is based on 
      the best available evidence and is a revised update of the British Thoracic 
      Society guideline on diagnostic flexible bronchoscopy.
