TI  - [Surgical treatment of primary malignant tumors of the trachea].
PG  - 32-4
AB  - The authors have performed 18 circular resections of the trachea (CRT) for 
      adenocystic cancer and typical carcinoid. In 10 of these patients more than 5 cm 
      of the tracheal segment were ablated. Postoperative radiotherapy was made on 8 
      patients with adenocystic cancer with lengthy CRT. Immediate and long-term 
      results were good that allowed the authors to recommend a single-stage circular 
      resection of the trachea in treatment of high differentiated forms of cancer.
